    "updated_at": "2025-02-14T16:32:54Z",
    "body": "To be clear we're also interested in addressing the privacy issues of popups, see https://github.com/privacycg/proposals/issues/47 and https://github.com/explainers-by-googlers/partitioned-popins\n\nThe cool thing a Promise would allow us to do would be to make it conditional based on some other trust indicator, e.g. (at worst) a user prompt.",
